#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2379
#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2391
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopieren"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2386
msgid "Read the debug log"
msgstr "Debug-Protokoll lesen"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2388
msgid ""
"The run writes a separate file with the ETIM values it found per variation."
msgstr ""
"Der Lauf schreibt eine separate Datei mit den pro Variante gefundenen ETIM-"
"Werten."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2398
msgid "What you see in the log"
msgstr "Was Sie im Protokoll sehen"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2399
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Was zu tun ist"

#. translators: 1: 'en' language code example, 2: 'en-GB' language code example
#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2407
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The API languages do not match. Make sure the plugin and the Skwirrel API "
"use the same language code (e.g. %1$s vs %2$s)."
msgstr ""
"Die API-Sprachen stimmen nicht überein. Stellen Sie sicher, dass das Plugin "
"und die Skwirrel-API denselben Sprachcode verwenden (z. B. %1$s vs. %2$s)."

#. translators: 1: wp_postmeta, 2: attribute_pa_
#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2420
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The attribute never reached the variation. Check %1$s for %2$s entries on "
"that variation ID."
msgstr ""
"Das Merkmal hat die Variante nie erreicht. Prüfen Sie %1$s auf %2$s-Einträge "
"bei dieser Varianten-ID."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2429
msgid ""
"Those products synced without any variation attributes at all — they are "
"listed by SKU at the end of the debug log."
msgstr ""
"Diese Produkte wurden ohne jegliche Variationsmerkmale synchronisiert — sie "
"sind am Ende des Debug-Protokolls nach SKU aufgelistet."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2432
msgid ""
"Switch the flag back off when you are done — it writes one line per "
"variation on every sync."
msgstr ""
"Schalten Sie das Flag wieder aus, wenn Sie fertig sind — es schreibt bei "
"jeder Synchronisierung eine Zeile pro Variante."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:2449
#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-settings.php:2795
